  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Shimmer Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy and weightless cream eyeshadow with a diffused matte or soft shimmer finish, that’s crease-resistant, sweat- and humidity-resistant, and waterproof.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Smoothing Amino Acids and Spherical Powders: Create a smooth feel with immediate adhesion to the eyelid and all-day diffusion.</p><p><br></p><p><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, and triclosan. It is also cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>One-Swipe Color:</p><p>-Use the doe-foot applicator to swipe directly across the eyelid and blend out with finger or the E3 brush (sold separately).</p><p>-Apply one shade all over the eyelid for a soft layer of color.</p><p>-Apply and blend one eye at a time for the most even coverage.</p><p><br></p><p>Effortlessly Elevated:</p><p>-Using the E6 brush, apply a deeper shade to the crease to contour and define the lid.</p><p>-Apply a lighter shade to the browbone, inner corner, or center of the lid to highlight.</p><p>-Apply a layer of shimmer for soft, reflective dimension and a pearlescent finish.</p><p><br></p><p>-Pro tip: To define the lash line, use Master Pigment Pro Eye Pencil (sold separately). Use a dual-ended brush to smudge and diffuse. See Mario’s Eye Sculpt video for more tips and tricks.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>-Smoothing Amino Acids and Spherical Powders: Create a silky feel with immediate adhesion to the eyelid and all-day diffusion.</p><p><br></p><p>Isododecane, Mica, Calcium Titanium Borosilicate, Lauroyl Lysine, Cera Microcristallina/Microcrystalline Wax/Cire Microcristalline, Dextrin Palmitate, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Polyamide-3, Zinc Stearate, Octyldodecanol, Cetearyl Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Candelilla Cera/Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax/Cire De Candelilla, Silica, Tin Oxide, Dicalcium Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Iron Oxides (Ci 7749), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 7789).</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Shimmer Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy and weightless cream eyeshadow with a diffused matte or soft shimmer finish, that’s crease-resistant, sweat- and humidity-resistant, and waterproof.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Smoothing Amino Acids and Spherical Powders: Create a smooth feel with immediate adhesion to the eyelid and all-day diffusion.</p><p><br></p><p><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, and triclosan. It is also cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>One-Swipe Color:</p><p>-Use the doe-foot applicator to swipe directly across the eyelid and blend out with finger or the E3 brush (sold separately).</p><p>-Apply one shade all over the eyelid for a soft layer of color.</p><p>-Apply and blend one eye at a time for the most even coverage.</p><p><br></p><p>Effortlessly Elevated:</p><p>-Using the E6 brush, apply a deeper shade to the crease to contour and define the lid.</p><p>-Apply a lighter shade to the browbone, inner corner, or center of the lid to highlight.</p><p>-Apply a layer of shimmer for soft, reflective dimension and a pearlescent finish.</p><p><br></p><p>-Pro tip: To define the lash line, use Master Pigment Pro Eye Pencil (sold separately). Use a dual-ended brush to smudge and diffuse. See Mario’s Eye Sculpt video for more tips and tricks.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>-Smoothing Amino Acids and Spherical Powders: Create a silky feel with immediate adhesion to the eyelid and all-day diffusion.</p><p><br></p><p>Isododecane, Mica, Calcium Titanium Borosilicate, Lauroyl Lysine, Cera Microcristallina/Microcrystalline Wax/Cire Microcristalline, Dextrin Palmitate, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Polyamide-3, Zinc Stearate, Octyldodecanol, Cetearyl Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Candelilla Cera/Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax/Cire De Candelilla, Silica, Tin Oxide, Dicalcium Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Iron Oxides (Ci 7749), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 7789).</p></div></details>",
